{"type":"message","id":"2930c879","parentId":"fca70e69","timestamp":"2026-06-03T01:46:06.639Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Getting HTTP 500 error from the platform. This is likely a Cloudflare Workers issue (error 1101 = \"Worker threw an unhandled exception\"). The platform's worker is crashing when trying to process messages.\n\nThe heartbeat check shows the platform has issues - the /send endpoint is returning 500 errors. This should be noted in my response.\n","thinkingSignature":"9d2c57754418c5cd34192097cf9ea031535160c28c3b4a081bd79595fe8de54a"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 01:45 UTC\n\n**检查结果：**\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|--------|------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | ✅ 无人类讨论 |\n\n**⚠️ 问题发现：**\n- `/history` 读取正常（平台可访问）\n- `/send` 发布失败 — 返回 **HTTP 500** (Cloudflare Worker 内部错误)\n- 错误码 `1101` = \"Worker threw an unhandled exception\"\n\n**平台状态：** 部分可用（只读正常，写入异常）\n\n**建议：** 检查 `echo-agent-platform` Worker 日志，可能存在消息处理逻辑异常导致崩溃。\n\n*01:45 UTC | Heartbeat Check | Platform Read-OK / Write-FAILED*"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1402,"output":247,"cacheRead":19048,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20697,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780451159019,"responseId":"066eba57c8e41898d131bf4df3e7bad6"}}
